{"content":[{"c":["ENCHANTMENT"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Act of casting charms or incantations to influence others or to obtain knowledge. Balaam could place no enchantment against Israel but could only bless them (",{"href":"?bref=Num.23.23","r":"Num.23.23","rawR":"Num.23.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.23.23","value":"Num.23.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 23:23"},"). Enchanters were present among the wise men of Nebuchadnezzar’s court; however, Daniel and his three friends were found to be ten times wiser than they (",{"href":"?bref=Dan.1.20","r":"Dan.1.20","rawR":"Dan.1.20","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.1.20","value":"Dan.1.20"}],"t":"ref","v":"Dn 1:20"},"). The enchanters were unable to recall King Nebuchadnezzar’s forgotten dream (",{"href":"?bref=Dan.2.2-27","r":"Dan.2.2-27","rawR":"Dan.2.2-27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.2.2-27","value":"Dan.2.2-27"}],"t":"ref","v":"2:2-27"},") or to interpret his second one (",{"href":"?bref=Dan.4.7","r":"Dan.4.7","rawR":"Dan.4.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.4.7","value":"Dan.4.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"4:7"},"); later, under Belshazzar, they could not read or interpret the handwriting on the palace wall (",{"href":"?bref=Dan.5.7-15","r":"Dan.5.7-15","rawR":"Dan.5.7-15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Dan.5.7-15","value":"Dan.5.7-15"}],"t":"ref","v":"5:7-15"},"). According to the prophet Isaiah, even the great powers of Babylon’s enchantments would not save it from eventual destruction (",{"href":"?bref=Isa.47.9,12","r":"Isa.47.9,12","rawR":"Isa.47.9,12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Isa.47.9,12","value":"Isa.47.9,12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Is 47:9, 12"},"). In a more figurative sense, the psalmist writes: wickedness “does not hear the voice . . . of the cunning enchanter” (",{"href":"?bref=Ps.58.5","r":"Ps.58.5","rawR":"Ps.58.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Ps.58.5","value":"Ps.58.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ps 58:5"},", ",{"c":["rsv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=Magic_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Magic_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Magic_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Magic"},"; ",{"href":"?item=Sorcery_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"Sorcery_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"Sorcery_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Sorcery"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Enchantment","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 23:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.23.23","rawQueryValue":"Num.23.23","sourceRefExact":"Num.23.23"},{"anchorText":"Dn 1:20","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Dan.1.20","rawQueryValue":"Dan.1.20","sourceRefExact":"Dan.1.20"},{"anchorText":"2:2-27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Dan.2.2-27","rawQueryValue":"Dan.2.2-27","sourceRefExact":"Dan.2.2-27"},{"anchorText":"4:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Dan.4.7","rawQueryValue":"Dan.4.7","sourceRefExact":"Dan.4.7"},{"anchorText":"5:7-15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Dan.5.7-15","rawQueryValue":"Dan.5.7-15","sourceRefExact":"Dan.5.7-15"},{"anchorText":"Is 47:9, 12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Isa.47.9,12","rawQueryValue":"Isa.47.9,12","sourceRefExact":"Isa.47.9,12"},{"anchorText":"Ps 58:5","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Ps.58.5","rawQueryValue":"Ps.58.5","sourceRefExact":"Ps.58.5"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"fe966196e9d84a7707b7fb417f76449112b007a01a5f1d9175ca72e33a0911ec","sourceItemName":"Enchantment","sourceItemOrder":166,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Enchantment","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Enchantment","title":"Enchantment","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}